740
00:41:47,000 --> 00:41:47,816
Go Bears!

741
00:41:47,916 --> 00:41:51,316
Wah. Waktu aku umur lima,
aku ikut tim sepak bola anak-anak

742
00:41:51,416 --> 00:41:53,108
namanya West Chesapeake Valley Thunderbolts

743
00:41:53,208 --> 00:41:54,816
disponsori oleh Bengkel Ban Shane.

744
00:41:54,916 --> 00:41:55,816
Kami tak menang satu pun pertandingan,

745
00:41:55,916 --> 00:41:57,191
dan pernah suatu kali,
ada anak cewek, Mindy,

746
00:41:57,291 --> 00:41:58,358
dia buang air besar di tengah lapangan.

747
00:41:58,458 --> 00:42:01,733
Ada yang mau cerita kisah
masa kecil yang tak penting lagi?

748
00:42:01,833 --> 00:42:03,233
Dibesarkan di penjara laboratorium.

749
00:42:03,791 --> 00:42:06,191
Maskot ayam, si pecandu meth, 
bertugas memutar papan iklan.

750
00:42:06,291 --> 00:42:07,958
