- Oh.

818
00:45:55,844 --> 00:45:56,941
Tiarap!

819
00:45:57,041 --> 00:45:58,775
- Aku bisa bantu.
- Tetap di belakangku.

820
00:46:00,833 --> 00:46:02,083
