keluar dari sini hidup-hidup.

841
00:47:06,083 --> 00:47:08,025
Aku sebenarnya tak ingin digendong lagi.

842
00:47:08,125 --> 00:47:10,708
Diam, Bob. Kau terluka, ingat?

843
00:47:25,375 --> 00:47:26,875
Kita butuh truk.

844
00:47:27,583 --> 00:47:29,066
Di mana Ava?

845
00:47:29,453 --> 00:47:32,566
Dia pergi. Tentu saja dia pergi.

846
00:47:32,666 --> 00:47:34,041
Sekarang bagaimana?

847
00:47:34,916 --> 00:47:36,583
Hei! Naik!

848
00:47:39,708 --> 00:47:41,400
Kau baik-baik saja di belakang?

849
00:47:41,500 --> 00:47:43,500
- Ya. Aman.
